# Normalise to LF. scripts/check-tokens.sh runs under bash in Linux CI, and a
# CRLF shebang fails there with a confusing "bad interpreter" error. This repo
# is authored on Windows, so leaving it to chance is not an option.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Screenshot baselines are committed artifacts and byte-compared by Playwright.
# Git must never touch them.
*.png binary
